        skos:definition        "The amount of a specified substance in a unit amount of another substance or matrix. While in chemistry the term \"concentration\" is always in relation to the total volume of a mixture, in oceanography the term has a broader meaning and it is also used for the amount of substance in the total mass of a mixture like e.g. sea water."@en , "Quantité d'une substance donnée par unité de quantité d'une autre substance ou matrice. Part d'une substance dans un mélange."@fr;
